{'symbol': 'NSC', 'date': '2022-06-23 16:15:00', 'title': 'NORFOLK SOUTHERN NAMES NABANITA NAG EXECUTIVE VICE PRESIDENT & CHIEF LEGAL OFFICER', 'text': "JASON MORRIS BECOMES VP LAW; WAI WONG ELEVATED TO VP LABOR RELATIONS ATLANTA , JUNE 23, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- NORFOLK SOUTHERN CORPORATION (NYSE:NSC) TODAY ANNOUNCED THREE CHANGES IN THE COMPANY'S EXECUTIVE MANAGEMENT TEAM. NABANITA NAG IS APPOINTED EXECUTIVE VICE PRESIDENT & CHIEF LEGAL OFFICER."}